    "detailed_description": "<u><strong>LEVEL UP YOUR BODY</strong></u> - A fitness VR Rhythm Boxing Game! Put on your VR headset and enter futuristic stages where you punch and hit objects to a rhythmic flowing beat. Avoid obstacles with finesse by crouching or skillfully evading.<br><br><u><strong>ACTIVE GAMEPLAY</strong></u> - By playing this game, you enhance your physical strength, increase endurance, refine coordination, all while sharpening your reflexes. Each gaming movement becomes a step toward a fitter and more agile self. Prepare to not only immerse yourself in a virtual world but also elevate your physical abilities to an entirely new level.<br><br><u><strong>CUSTOM LEVEL SUPPORT</strong></u>  - Play custom levels created by either other users or yourself.<br><br><u><strong>VR LEVEL EDITOR</strong></u> - With our innovative VR level editor, you can craft unique game levels by mapping your favorite songs and melodies directly in VR. Immerse yourself in your creations and experience the rhythm like never before.",
